      "message": "don\u0027t we need to check the EXPORT_OPTION_MD_WRITE_ACCESS\n\nsimilar to what\u0027s there in the nfs4_op_open():\n/* Check export permissions if OPEN4_CREATE */\n        if ((arg_OPEN4-\u003eopenhow.opentype \u003d\u003d OPEN4_CREATE) \u0026\u0026\n            ((op_ctx-\u003eexport_perms.options \u0026 EXPORT_OPTION_MD_WRITE_ACCESS) \u003d\u003d\n             0)) {\n                res_OPEN4-\u003estatus \u003d NFS4ERR_ROFS;\n\nCC: @ffilzlnx@mindspring.com",
      "revId": "bfd1601685d309922c4a494a837a5dd81767e53a",
